{
    "title": "Motocross Bike Racing Game",
    "description": "In this game, players need to control their motorcycles and engage in a speed competition on a straight track, in order to increase their speed to the fastest in the shortest possible time. The core challenge of the game is to find the best acceleration time and braking points, striving to achieve maximum speed on the track.\r\n\r\nIn addition, players must carefully avoid obstacles to prevent conflicts and slow down.\r\n\r\nYou can use various methods to deal with very dangerous levels such as high mountains and snow. There are various motorcycles in the game, and you can choose from them at will.\r\n\r\nIn the game, players can compete on different routes, fully utilizing their speed and skills to win.\r\n\r\nCome and sprint with me!",
    "descriptionHTML": "In this game, players need to control their motorcycles and engage in a speed competition on a straight track, in order to increase their speed to the fastest in the shortest possible time. The core challenge of the game is to find the best acceleration time and braking points, striving to achieve maximum speed on the track.<br><br>In addition, players must carefully avoid obstacles to prevent conflicts and slow down.<br><br>You can use various methods to deal with very dangerous levels such as high mountains and snow. There are various motorcycles in the game, and you can choose from them at will.<br><br>In the game, players can compete on different routes, fully utilizing their speed and skills to win.<br><br>Come and sprint with me!",
